    "text": "By Clayton Wollner ,\n1 days ago Sandra Louise Clemons, 63 of Harlan died on August 4th, 2026. Memorial services for Sandra Clemons will be held on Thursday August 27th, 2026 at 10:30 A.M. at the Immanuel Lutheran Church in Harlan. A visitation will be held on Wednesday August 26th, 2026 from 5:30 P.M. to 7:00 P.M. at the Immanuel Lutheran Church in Harlan. Pauley Jones Funeral Home In Harlan has the arrangements. Read full article",
